    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b3536d024f17f7e5a588b463",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "杏目最出色的地方。\n并非其卓越的才能，也不是天赋。\n而是――追求胜利的强烈意志。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d3d6f07d2423ad268fef0eaff38b5e6ec462b144a380fd10f3a2ef13c777d1b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        38,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/38/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6042563b0ffc17726e40e1d5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了胜利，她愿意付出任何努力。\n如果对手身处海外，\n她会毫不犹豫地奔赴那里……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3415b480deb0edb277d6a0e2bd925403ae1956ccbb7841bed27e5826d8b57601",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        39,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/39/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9f51e6610f5ad6a5baeb644",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在向那个记录发起挑战、与之比肩的过程中……\n必将催生下一个伟业。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ede3238040349eeab8baa26dc7efd44497d4f0ce0c407d7e6559f790af2ea25b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        4,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/4/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f020f87a7ac3634acc39d585",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……诶？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f161f665efce1e5ee1df388903c168da302fe1992cff1b29667536a61e16027e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
