    {
      "uid": "zhcn:533dfb7e789263e5c8920423",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "你的梦想是什么？",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4e4ed854507e04f303ccdd905b22e92f922b0f2dcafe90db3ac007c6450cc05",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        41,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/41/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f61144f33dfaf4ad66f70d9d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她的注视，令我的思绪瞬间凝滞。\n那双饱含光芒的眼瞳……在夕阳下闪耀着鲜红。",
      "source_fingerprint": "632f0c34ab300edb866b11203d6766a9e13f6fe3364b9e31797f8867adcccd19",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        42,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/42/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dae83a611422c2c45fa1b336",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "与她签约时，心中怀抱的希望――\n被照亮了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "234816b2c0d38e886586b7aaf81a6abf0a98e308c1776bd9f6eee4d4f0115993",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        43,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/43/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dfbeff47529738274a0aaa88",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我的梦想是――让你获胜",
      "source_fingerprint": "45970a0c4f1e5d54b29f8acdc9c4387a54b10c317b4de2a591d94fe15d0d914e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        44,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/44/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:88bc61aec111316896000ee3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我的梦想是――让你获胜",
      "source_fingerprint": "45970a0c4f1e5d54b29f8acdc9c4387a54b10c317b4de2a591d94fe15d0d914e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        44,
        "choice_data_list",
        1
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/44/choice_data_list/1"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9ccbc4e49d5c061fdc7a14a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "比任何人都强烈的求胜意志，究竟能抵达何方\n――对未来的期待，开始熠熠生辉……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "63be3c07d29c1e4d4a0dee4cda5d37105b74c140b8f9ce330af9ada87b601757",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        44,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/44/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0d9addc1e8ef4b9c786b67d3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在不断积累的胜利前方，会展开怎样的未来呢\n……我想要见证。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bbdf30f694a7446a83dfdc9579e99e1ac7479a701c7fb5e2cac46a37104cf3a0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        45,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/45/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec76713a7173e9e1e4ea5d0f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "杏目",
      "source_fingerprint": "b632be927b5d52ab85b0cfae236cdc76e44b41d48ba6e925027a4013417d1d5f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
