    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0610d8b805029036665b757",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "接下来你要制定训练计划对吧？\n你一定会打磨到心底满意为止。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6180d2f5951863f169b9cf3551f5e993f1abe827f9c411912b1de0026635dcf5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        49,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/49/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e885c71b39d572aad6d07b97",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“皇帝”鲁道夫象征。史上首位、\n以无败之姿斩获经典三冠的赛马娘。\n而她最大的功绩是――",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a59907f57077e3948db1ccf33b674c42ec254a2d9c552f16c039a08a06add1d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1847925039759d1658979693",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "杏目",
      "source_fingerprint": "b632be927b5d52ab85b0cfae236cdc76e44b41d48ba6e925027a4013417d1d5f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1129/storytimeline_501129100.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        50,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/50/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d78eacabeb28089472cfb5f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "毕竟你是不想输给自己的人呢。\n所以我才会选择你。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e31210e43ef7d50738eade968c339246a19011e3810c1399c66ee2c7dcf44566",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
